Changes in version 0.99.7
+ Bug fix in legend generation for qualitative and sequential color scales.

Changes in version 0.99.6
+ Improved ID mapping for KEGG pathways.
+ Darker color palette for the default qualitative color scale.

Changes in version 0.99.5
+ If all color gradients are the same, only one gradient will be plotted in the legend.
+ Font size of network diagrams can now be adjusted.
+ Bug fixes: if graph id is absent in GPML file, some node-group interactions were not shown in the network visualization. This has been fixed.

Changes in version 0.99.4
+ If no visualization variables are provided, GPML2Network() and KGML2Network() functions will generate plain network diagram.
+ Package description updated.

Changes in version 0.99.3
+ docs folder removed and website moved to https://synum-lab.github.io/PinPath-web/.
+ DESCRIPTON file updated: R dependency version (>= 4.6.0) and lazyLoad field.
+ Document and script added about how example data files were generated.
+ Installation instructions updated in vignette and README.

Changes in version 0.99.2
+ Typos fixed in website.
+ Documentation updated: indicate that usage of openFile is only available for Windows.

Changes in version 0.99.1
+ Default value of openFile set to FALSE.
+ Documentation updated.
